{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05164","headline":"奉陪张燕公登南楼 · 尹懋","name":"奉陪张燕公登南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子每垂眷，江山共流眄。\n水远林外明，岩近雾中见。\n终日西北望，何处是京县。\n屡登高春台，徒使泪如霰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹懋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}